The '''Tranquil Pass''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Tranquil Pass''' is a long tunnel that connects the {{Zone|Moonglade's Edge}} and {{Zone|Westbound Wetlands}} to the {{zone|Tranquility Sanctum}}. {{Item|Bamboo}} can be collected here. 

